  "title": "Orla Receives Court Approval for Business Combination with Equinox Gold",
  "summary": "Vancouver, BC – July 28, 2026 – Orla Mining Ltd. (TSX: OLA; NYSE: ORLA) (“Orla” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce that the Supreme Court of British Columbia has granted the final order in connection with the Company’s previously announced business combination (the “Arrangement”) with Equinox Gold Corp. (TSX: EQX, NYSE American: EQX) (“Equinox Gold”) pursuant to a court-approved […]",
